{"group_id": "D0109", "name": "D0109求对称点坐标", "difficulty": 9, "text": "<div>\\(已知直线 3x - y -5 = 0, 求点 M(-1,2) 关于该直线的对称点。\\)</div><div><svg width=\"400\" height=\"400\" style=\"background-color:#f9f9f9; margin-top:10px;\">\n            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            <text x=\"385\" y=\"195\">x</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"15\">y</text>\n            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"900.0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"-300.0\" stroke=\"blue\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"160\" r=\"4\" fill=\"red\"/>\n            <text x=\"185\" y=\"155\" fill=\"red\">M(-1,2)</text>\n            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"200\" r=\"4\" fill=\"purple\"/>\n            <text x=\"305\" y=\"195\" fill=\"purple\">M'(?,?)</text>\n            <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"purple\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"/>\n            <text x=\"15\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"blue\">3x - y -5 = 0</text>\n        </svg></div>", "answer": {"type": "numeric", "solution": ["(5,0)", "5,0"]}},
{"group_id": "D0109", "name": "D0109求对称点坐标", "difficulty": 9, "text": "<div>\\(已知直线 -3x - 4y -6 = 0, 求点 M(1,4) 关于该直线的对称点。\\)</div><div><svg width=\"400\" height=\"400\" style=\"background-color:#f9f9f9; margin-top:10px;\">\n            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            <text x=\"385\" y=\"195\">x</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"15\">y</text>\n            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"80.0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"380.0\" stroke=\"blue\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"120\" r=\"4\" fill=\"red\"/>\n            <text x=\"225\" y=\"115\" fill=\"red\">M(1,4)</text>\n            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"280\" r=\"4\" fill=\"purple\"/>\n            <text x=\"105\" y=\"275\" fill=\"purple\">M'(?,?)</text>\n            <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"purple\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"/>\n            <text x=\"15\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"blue\">-3x - 4y -6 = 0</text>\n        </svg></div>", "answer": {"type": "numeric", "solution": ["(-5,-4)", "-5,-4"]}},
{"group_id": "D0109", "name": "D0109求对称点坐标", "difficulty": 9, "text": "<div>\\(已知直线 x + 2y -6 = 0, 求点 M(1,0) 关于该直线的对称点。\\)</div><div><svg width=\"400\" height=\"400\" style=\"background-color:#f9f9f9; margin-top:10px;\">\n            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            <text x=\"385\" y=\"195\">x</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"15\">y</text>\n            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"blue\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"200\" r=\"4\" fill=\"red\"/>\n            <text x=\"225\" y=\"195\" fill=\"red\">M(1,0)</text>\n            <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"120\" r=\"4\" fill=\"purple\"/>\n            <text x=\"265\" y=\"115\" fill=\"purple\">M'(?,?)</text>\n            <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"purple\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"/>\n            <text x=\"15\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"blue\">x + 2y -6 = 0</text>\n        </svg></div>", "answer": {"type": "numeric", "solution": ["(3,4)", "3,4"]}},

{"group_id": "D0201", "name": "D0201配方法求顶点式", "difficulty": 1, "text": "\\(\\begin{gather}把函数 y=x^2+6x+14 配成顶点式。 \\\\ \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|} \n            \\hline +3 & +3x & 9\\\\ \n            \\hline x & x^2 & +3x \\\\\n            \\hline   & x & +3 \\\\\n            \\hline\n        \\end{array} \\\\ \\textup{输入格式:y=(x+m)^2+n} \\end{gather}", "answer": {"type": "numeric", "solution": ["y=(x+3)^2+5", "(x+3)^2+5"]}},
